{
  "summary": "Commissioner's Bulletin B-2027-Q1-117 amends Section C of the Texas Statistical Plan for Residential Risks effective January 1, 2027 by adding a mandatory one-character Reinsurance Coverage Indicator at column 184 of the Premium Record Layout. It establishes RCI values Y, N, and U, limits the change to prospective Premium records only, and requires U-coded records to be reconciled and resubmitted with Y or N within 90 days.",
